 fuzz target, SPEC and CODECS rows

tests: KLZ and KLZH must keep writing rc3's bytes (hashes taken from the rc3 sources); seven
KLZH2 frames written by this commit must keep decoding and together hold every chunk kind
(test-only counters, -DKLZ_TEST_HOOKS). test_native_modes.py runs lz2 and lz2,huf.
fuzz/fuzz_native_lz.c: libFuzzer target for the KLZ, KLZH and KLZH2 decoders (none had one).
SPEC.md and research/CODECS.md rows for codec 32; docs/NATIVE-PLAN.md names the opt-in.

